1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,240
At the same age,
some people have already gone so far.

2
00:00:06,290 --> 00:00:08,360
Meanwhile we sometimes
still ask ourselves,

3
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:10,210
where are we actually heading?

4
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,400
Then, without realizing it,
other people's lives start to feel

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,690
like deadlines
for our own.

6
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,080
Yet we didn't even start
from the same place.

7
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:20,160
Some have plenty of choices.

8
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:23,820
Others have to fight first
just to get one chance.

9
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:26,400
And only we know

10
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,510
how much we had to go through
to get to this point.

11
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:33,120
Including the days
we never even talk about.

12
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:36,350
So why are we so quick
to call ourselves behind,

13
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:40,060
just because our lives don't look
like someone else's?

14
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:43,370
Maybe you're not falling behind.

15
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,700
Maybe your life was never meant

16
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:48,060
to follow anyone else's schedule.

17
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:50,530
Not everything
has to happen now.

18
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:54,500
And not every journey has to look
extraordinary to matter.

19
00:00:54,550 --> 00:00:55,960
You are not late.

20
00:00:56,010 --> 00:00:58,300
You're living your own life.

